note bottom of Broker
  R-UNTRUSTED: class recorded at registration/admission, never inferred from name.
  Broker refuses untrusted subscription bindings/leases; no workplace gets one,
  including trusted-circle workers. Donor model credentials stay donor-side.
  R-NET-TOOL default no web; optional donor search key held by separate swarma-web
  B identity/C sandbox (A donor Keychain/0600 file), never harness/bridge identity.
  No key in channel/package or project request method; pending qualification/formats.
  Cleanup export precedes retiring; distinct execution evidence and bounded original-admission consent.
  Ordinary expiry only; holds need separate authority. Result + all blobs verified durable outside deletion.
  Refusal/unknown retains obligation; current-authority bounded repair or per-act waiver; standing discard off.
  Retained content release requires authenticated import acknowledgement or explicit authorized release.
  [[remote-worker-transfer.puml Detailed transfer, refusal repair and cleanup custody]]
end note
@enduml
